      "kind": "note",
      "text": "H100 SXM5 dense FP16/BF16 with FP32 accumulation 989.4 TFLOPS and non-Tensor FP32 66.9 TFLOPS from whitepaper v1.04 Table 3. Memory 80GB/3.35TB/s from Sep24 SXM datasheet; rounded sparse headlines and NVL values are not used."
