    {
      "kind": "note",
      "text": "FP32 non-Tensor peak is used as the existing generic vector compute-class ceiling, not a measured softmax/SFU throughput."
    },
    {
      "kind": "note",
      "text": "Whole device only; no MIG, power-cap/thermal derating or measured efficiency is inferred. Unknown capabilities and communication defaults are absent."
    },
    {
      "kind": "note",
      "text": "Homogeneous inputDtypes listed once or as two operands are explicit equivalent precision entries. No mixed-type matching or input-count multiplier is inferred."
    },
